Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,弱小 是原罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要我手下留情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能相信的只有自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想要不屈从于任何人的利牙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟随我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,又是那能量饮料吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,亏你大清早能喝下那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能提神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,味道像是小时候被迫喝下的感冒药
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那种糖浆的 太甜了 巨难喝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才笑了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你看错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你肯定笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让我再看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你看错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞什么 小烤鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再笑一回嘛 好不好 喂 说你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟这里太过荒凉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想尽量不让她寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把该做的做完之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你就带她回故乡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者既无故乡可归 也无坟可吊唁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只得化作无名白骨 消散于荒原
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就让她在这里 在家人身边安息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能让她好好安息 我们得了结这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追山路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他是这一切的源头 以及中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要击溃组织 必须除掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}那边交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,已经获得了能证明他们犯罪行径的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些透露给媒体 他们肯定会有动作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会浪费她留下的遗物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉在你们干劲十足时打搅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,出大问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是提取出来的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但被高明地加密了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不解开这个 就没人能查看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 居然加密了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}干的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是提取数据的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你指艾玛?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对 看来她不论如何都想保护这数据
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,直到亲自交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,总之这份好意反倒坏事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想要一探究竟 就得解这该死的谜题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能做到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,首先分析算法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,确定用的是哪种加密方式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}建设中的设施遭到了恐怖分子袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,据悉 犯人是主张环境保护的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,激进环保组织的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这下您懂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是惨无人道的恐怖分子搞的破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,发电站爆炸绝对不是事故
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我再次向您保证发电站绝对安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我老实相信你的话?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对 您看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,舆论站在我们这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也向您在意的顾问委员会的各位成员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,都作了详细说明 并让他们信服了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你也那样和各种媒体详细说明过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 误会解除 问题消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们携手推进发电站的开发工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起重绘世界的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不能立即下判断
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没有完全证明发电站安全
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 下次再有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就有必要重新审视这个计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还望铭记于心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,结束谈话时 最好不要口出不逊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那样不会给人留下好的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您的好建议
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一群无能之辈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴乖乖顺从我就行了 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,社长 已确认公司的主服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,曾受外部非法访问
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,服务器中存储的绝密数据可能已泄漏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么就是不如我所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,目前的情况不是很乐观
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,具足装备和反应堆的开发数据已到手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以自主建设产线了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被他们抢先了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就算透露给媒体…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:09:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很可能都{\fsp8}被{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}收买了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的新闻行业
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,事越大 他们越能从贪污受贿中获利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有些主张{\fsp8}反{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}的独立媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能合作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,情报战他们更拿手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,单纯透露给媒体的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,会败给他们的情报操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要一个强力的推手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 要放到逗音上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,火了的话能有三百万播放量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,内容就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在巨乳美女摇曳的胸前 贴{\fsp8}上{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}的犯罪数据…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我有想法了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你继续解除加密
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是乌鸦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是战书
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,战书?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们由戒律联结
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,受戒律保护
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因戒律而生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 我们为戒律而死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为戒律而死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是世上顶尖强者的名号
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因此站在忍者之巅的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.51,0:10:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有着能主宰世界的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,主宰世界的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我认输
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 胜负已分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:11:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,弱者 无权留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是弱者 他和你一样是忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说一样?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一同保护日本的同胞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没有实力的人就该被舍弃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到这一点的人 会死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能独自战斗下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,既然彼此意见不合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来证明一下谁是对的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,用实践来证明
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这才算忍者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,结果是 平局
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,身手不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他人严格 却对乌鸦亲切呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不像是「死神」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都那样称呼你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟和你交手过的人全都失去自信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,无法继续参加训练了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一人是例外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你也会对乌鸦以外的事物感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就算不想 你也会了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为以后还要一起训练
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,通过此次考试的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这三位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在向诸位下达任务
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,完成任务之际
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,将允许诸位自称忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,取得了目标物品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个带回去就行 赶紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,增援部队 太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,难不成是情报泄露?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这一条路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去会被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算独自殿后?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有实力的人会死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而已
Comment: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,black scene (forward 1s)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我的背后交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,汇报完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是考验他们?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我寻求的只有强者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么跑回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该以任务为先
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:16:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那样做也是为了成功完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你很强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但三人一起能做成更大的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘记 你不是独自一人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我从出生起 就被父母抛弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该葬身于荒山
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是它们代替父亲给了我食物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我能相信的只有它们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,以及自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次将背后托付给别人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们同行 能看到不同的景色吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.45,0:16:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,脱离组织?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打破了戒律
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们起誓过的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一起赌上性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一同前行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那就 杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,否则
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我就杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸 鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真是瘆人的废墟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是曾经的忍者村
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那玩意不能无视掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不用特意应战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他是从很久以前追逐而来的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法逃避过往而前行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,叛忍全都得死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 说不定有一天会刀剑相向
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你该知道 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,本来预计退休的部下突然成恐怖分子了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.89,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,换个地方说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了她 我找到{\fsp8}了{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}犯罪的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最后 她都在坚持做自己该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你{\fsp8}是{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}的走狗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:02.25,Top,,0,0,0,,但我不{\fsp8}信{\fsp0}FB{\fsp8}I{\fsp0}的所有人都{\fsp8}被{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}收买了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:05.74,Top,,0,0,0,,应该有没回应他们的 正直的搜查员
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}和{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}勾结的你 应该知道有哪些人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想请你把艾玛留下的证据交给那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只觉得你陷入了妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 我为什么要答应你的请求
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在对身为分局长的你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而是在对以前曾一起追踪罪犯的搭档说话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:38.85,Default,,600,0,0,,保护市民不受坏人所害是我们的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:40.12,Default,,600,0,0,,不记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:43.85,Default,,600,0,0,,这是第一次见面时 你对我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那些往事 我早忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,找到迈克了 立马派增援来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别耍小伎俩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让我见识你的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那时你该杀了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的过错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我要用你的血洗刷我的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我有该做的事 不能在这里死去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为彼此的过往 做个了结吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Comment: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:34.84,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(732.706,707.295)\c&HE7E9FF&}AUZ{\fsp4}A{\fsp0}设施受恐怖分子袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:34.84,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H151515&\b1\pos(94.486,827.596)}AUZ{\fsp4}A{\fsp0}发言人称 在建发电站发生的爆炸为蓄意破坏所致
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:41.84,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HE7E9FF&\pos(976.941,889.413)}AUZ{\fsp4}A{\fsp0}设施受恐怖分子袭击
Comment: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.91,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Comment: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.24,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Comment: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:55.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Comment: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:00.25,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Comment: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.93,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Comment: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:12.85,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Comment: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:17.40,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:22.61,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Comment: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:27.91,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Comment: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:33.04,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Comment: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:38.38,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Comment: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:43.05,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:46.01,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Comment: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.24,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Comment: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:55.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Comment: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:00.25,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Comment: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.93,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Comment: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:12.85,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Comment: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:17.40,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Comment: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:22.61,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Comment: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:27.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Comment: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:33.04,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Comment: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:38.38,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Comment: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:43.05,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:46.01,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
